Most adults 40 to 75 years of age with diabetes are at intermediate or high risk of a first ASCVD event.¹²⁻¹⁵ Moderate-intensity statin therapy to achieve a ≥30% to 49% reduction in LDL-C provides ASCVD risk reduction in patients with diabetes.¹²,¹⁶⁻¹⁸ However, given the increased

